        "original_id": "1a539180-b998-5d50-a9c2-1b1ade2f5e6d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dorian Lord, Robin Strasser, Lord Byron\n- Works: One Life to Live\n- Families: Cramer family\n- Concepts: Byronic hero, Romantic hero\n- Roles: fictional character, matriarch, primary antagonist\n\nFacts:\n- The Byronic hero is a type of character that is a variant of the Romantic hero.\n- The Byronic hero is named after the English Romantic poet Lord Byron.\n- Dorian Lord is a fictional character on the American daytime drama One Life to Live.\n- Dorian Lord is the matriarch of the Cramer family on One Life to Live.\n- For most of One Life to Live's history, Dorian Lord is the show's primary antagonist and a Byronic hero.\n- Actress Robin Strasser played Dorian Lord most notably and for the longest duration.",
